# Not needed for the server image - keeps the build context small
# (a smaller context is also what fixed the "unknown file mode" tar error).
# NOTE: apps/client/package.json must stay reachable (not excluded) - the
# Dockerfile copies it so `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` can see the whole
# workspace graph. Docker won't let a later "!" re-include a file whose
# parent directory is already excluded, so exclude client's subpaths
# individually instead of the whole apps/client folder.
apps/client/src
apps/client/public
apps/client/index.html
apps/client/.env.example
docs
